CodeSystem: IVRSnomedCTSupplement
Id: IVR-sct-supplement
Title: "IVR SNOMED CT Translations"
Description: "Code system supplement with the German, French and Italian terms of the SNOMED CT concepts used in the IVR value sets. It contains the terms that the SNOMED CT Swiss Edition does not provide: the concept has no term in the language yet, or the IVR term differs from the preferred term of the Swiss Edition. For all other concepts and languages the preferred term of the Swiss Edition applies."
